        "subject": "LU-21195 ptlrpc: select OST for delayed ping fail_loc",
        "message": "LU-21195 ptlrpc: select OST for delayed ping fail_loc\n\nrecovery-small test_200 arms OBD_FAIL_PTLRPC_DELAY_SEND_FAIL and\npings OST0000, but the one-shot fail_loc can delay the pinger's ping\nto MDT0000 instead. That ping has a much longer timeout, so no\nOST0000 request times out within the wait window and the test fails\nwith \"RPC did not time out\".\n\nLet the high 16 bits of fail_val select the OST whose ping is\ndelayed, as index + 1 in the cfs_fail_index() form, with the low 16\nbits the delay in seconds. Use it in test_200 for OST0000, and only\naccept a timeout of an OST0000 ping.\n\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I4634757e8a3d81f4d139ba4bf24e40eeb6d6d00c\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
